<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Ranger Weapons</h1>
<p>The weapon skills the Rangers' guild teaches, in Alquenburg. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the weapon there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each weapon has its own help: help and the weapon's name.
</p>
<pre>Name           Level   Up to
Fist               0   70%
Rapier             1   100%
Sling              1   100%
Dagger             3   80%
Club               4   100%
Quarterstaff       5   100%
Short Sword        5   85%
Hand Axe           6   60%
Kick Small         8   90%
Mace               9   70%
Bow               10   100%
Spear             14   100%
Long Sword        16   100%
Crossbow          20   100%
</pre>
<p><br />
